{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_08",
  "title": "嘉維爾之拳",
  "storyCode": "RI-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "738c6ede10ded7d1995853f50567ccca997098b5243634b017de66d29334d409",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "這裡的樓房跟其他部族明顯不一樣了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "破房子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "唔，這裡的建築和裝飾好粗糙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "不過奇怪的器械殘骸到處都是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，你的部族建設得挺特別啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "看來他們也和你一樣喜歡搗鼓機器了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "這都是我的族人們的傑作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯。他們也都體會到了機械的魅力，憑藉著自己的熱情將這個部族建設到了現在這個樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "text": "快看，是嘉維爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "text": "大酋長說的是真的，她要用大醜和嘉維爾再進行一次對決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "text": "什麼？！這怎麼能錯過！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "哇，好多人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "這些人裡有不少是在祭典後聚集到這裡來的其他部族的人，他們也將會加入我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哦，所以你要說些什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嘉維爾，原本如果你就那麼離開的話，我不會管你。但是你既然你又站在我的面前，那麼我就要在這裡打倒你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "因為你太強了，嘉維爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你還記得那一天嗎，嘉維爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "那一天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "在那天之前，我和你一樣，堅信自己的拳頭就是一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "哇啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "text": "嘉維爾勝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哈哈，我又贏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "哼，再來，下次我一定會贏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "好呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "咦，大地怎麼在震動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "看，是那邊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "那......那是什麼啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "好大的鐵塊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "text": "那是薩爾貢的移動城市......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "薩爾貢是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "text": "薩爾貢是我們的國家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "移動城市又是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "text": "移動城市就是很大的部族，在上面住著許多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "text": "我也是年輕時有一次上去看到過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "text": "好了，別害怕，它不會開過來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "text": "那是和我們一輩子都沒關係的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，你怎麼了，身體不舒服嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "沒什麼，我先回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哦，我記得啊，薩爾貢的移動城市正好開過了我們這裡附近嘛，從那天之後你就變得怪怪的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我反而覺得不可思議，嘉維爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "看到那樣的東西，難道不會覺得驚訝嗎？不會覺得震撼嗎？不會覺得自己渺小嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "你問我那天的感受，那確實是覺得“哇，好大啊”，可是那和我有什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你總是這樣，嘉維爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "在那天之後，我就對和你打架失去了興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我拜託依娜姆幫我尋找和機械有關的書籍，開始學習薩爾貢語和機械知識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "然後我遇到了大祭司，我們兩個人開始一起製造大醜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "這我知道啊，我不是還去找過你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "嗯？這麼說來，那邊那隻怪傢伙就是你的隱形朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "沒錯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "哇，什麼時候到我身邊來的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "總覺得跟大帝老闆一樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "大帝？你是說那隻企鵝嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "是的，咦，你認識老闆嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "認識認識，當然認識，雖然我們大概有幾十年沒見面了，咦，是幾十年嗎？還是幾百年？算了，反正你身上確實有那傢伙的氣味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "幾百年是怎麼回事啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "誒誒誒，沒想到老闆在這裡還有朋友！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "原來你真的存在啊，我一直以為是祖瑪瑪腦子出問題了出現了幻覺，在羅德島的時候我還專門研究過類似的病症咧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "噢，你不知道，嘉維爾，小時候你來找祖瑪瑪的時候，我一直在旁邊看著！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "就像這樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "消失了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "哈哈哈，我平時是不會出現在你們的面前的，但是現在要駕駛大醜，所以就沒辦法啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "不過跟小傢伙們一起造機器還是挺有趣的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "說到大醜，你不去駕駛真的沒關係嗎？我看要撞到房子了誒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "啊？啊，我忘了！那等會兒聊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "嗚哇，真的一下子又回到駕駛席了，好厲害啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "果然和老闆一樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哦，差點忘了你還在說話。不過老實說，祖瑪瑪，反正最後都要打一架，你說這些真的有必要嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "這些話是說給你聽的，也是說給我自己聽的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你知道嗎，嘉維爾，對我來說，你是最大的阻礙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "啊？是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "確切地說，不是你，而是你這樣的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我曾經試圖想要說服許多人去瞭解機器的魅力，但是最終，他們中有絕大多數都不感興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "因為有你這樣厲害的人在給他們做榜樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你這樣的存在告訴他們，在這裡，能打就能夠獲得想要的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你的強大，堵死了前進的道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "所以我下定決心，我要打破人們的這種想法，我要用更強的力量，摧毀你建立起的這種對自身力量的盲目崇拜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "誒，博士，我覺得她說的蠻有道理的啊，你覺得呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "確實。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "博士，你到底是幫哪邊的啊！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可頌",
              "text": "雖然確實有道理，但是又好像有哪裡不對......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "機器不錯。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "對啊，那個大傢伙酷誒！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "不過老實說，我也快要被你說服了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "但是我也沒想做大家的榜樣啊，我只代表我自己，我覺得拳頭可以解決一切，關別人什麼事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我知道，這不怪你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "但是，我依然決心打敗你，嘉維爾，用這大醜的力量。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "所有人聽好了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "接下來，大醜將和嘉維爾重新進行一次決鬥。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "這場戰鬥將決定誰才是真正的大酋長！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "大祭司，要戰鬥了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，沒問題！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嘉維爾，準備好了嗎！讓你的同伴一起上也沒關係！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我都已經等不及了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "你們別來插手，這一戰，我要親手打倒這個大傢伙！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "來吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "先試試正常功率！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "我射！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
